00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:03.970
Sister!

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:07.930
Sister!

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:20.560
Sister!

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:33.220
I'm... fine.

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:36.100
You're not fine! Not at all!

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:43.310
I won't die... I'm fine...
Leave me be... I'm fi--

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:45.060
Just shut up!

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:58.220
I'm fine.

00:03:58.220 --> 00:04:00.720
No! You're not!

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:04.560
Anyways, we've gotta run!

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:07.930
Crashing like that,
the Executioners will be onto us!

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:08.930
We're running?

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:11.020
Yeah, we're running!

00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:14.560
Where are we going?

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:15.810
Huh?

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:16.680
"Kansai Special Communication Room"
"Sky Hall"

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:20.390
"Kansai Special Communication Room"
"Sky Hall"

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:20.390
Good work recovering the offering to Kanto.

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:21.770
"Kansai Special Communication Room"
"Sky Hall"

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:21.770
But yet again, it seems
you let the Akudama escape.

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:26.020
But yet again, it seems
you let the Akudama escape.

