00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:31.310
Of course. You've been nothing but incompetent.

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:35.100
Execute every last Akudama
involved in this incident.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.350
Failure will not be tolerated!

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:41.430
Your punishment will depend
on how you handle this.

00:04:41.430 --> 00:04:44.600
Don't think we'll let you off easy.

00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:47.770
Right. I'll keep that in mind.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:53.560
Hmm? I see how it is.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:56.220
"Kansai North Ward"
"Science Research Institute"

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:56.220
Their cells don't age at all.

00:04:56.180 --> 00:05:01.680
And just like stem cells,
they can divide indefinitely.

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:06.600
Could this be the secret to their immortality?

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:08.930
How titillating.

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:17.970
There's always that one guy
who takes extra-long breaks.

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:19.520
Akudama!

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:27.180
Unbelievable. I'm not an Akudama anymore.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:29.560
Help... me...!

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:36.180
I'm Doctor. It's my job to play with lives.

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:38.890
Let's make your pain go away.

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:54.850
Yes... I play with lives, including my own.

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:05.720
I'll hold on to this, children.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:12.470
Hold up!

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:15.100
"Outside Kansai"
"Fortification Wall  North Side"

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:19.970
"Outside Kansai"
"Fortification Wall  North Side"

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:19.970
My body hurts... My feet hurt...
My back hurts...

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:24.810
And I'm starving. If only we had that backpack.

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:27.060
But it's gone for good.

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:29.890
I know. It's bullshit.

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:31.140
You have a dirty mouth.

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:33.600
