00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:36.890
I'm known for my good moral character!

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:38.520
Good moral character?

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:40.930
It means I'm a good person!

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:42.720
But you say "bullshit"?

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:48.810
I don't! Being around those
Akudama gave me bad habits!

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:49.890
They're bad?

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:51.140
Huh?

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:56.720
I don't know who's bad anymore.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:01.430
Through that tunnel is Kansai!

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:06.640
That's where my home is!
And I've got food and clothes, so we'll be fine!

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:08.470
C'mon, let's go!

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:12.720
"Execution Department HQ"
"Monument Hall"

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:17.600
