00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:22.270
I assume you called me here for a reason?

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:25.350
This is your partner now.

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:27.930
Nice to meet you, Senpai!

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:32.640
That won't be necessary. I'm fine on my own.

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:36.810
So you say. Though your
right eye begs to differ.

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:43.430
You should thank the Akudama
for hesitating instead of killing you.

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:48.770
Need I remind you that Executioners
work as a pair? No exceptions.

00:07:48.770 --> 00:07:53.520
I'll say it again--I'm fine on my own.
I'm not pairing with anyone.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.270
Don't act like a child!

00:07:55.270 --> 00:08:00.270
Your master is no longer with us
as a result of his actions.

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:03.140
Don't cling to the dead.

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:07.680
I will execute those Akudama on my own.

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:10.810
That's the last promise I made with Master.

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:13.270
The last promise <i>you </i>made.

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:17.310
Do you think I can't tell
you're thirsty for death?

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:26.100
I'm finally back!
I never thought I'd see the day!

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:29.600
Let's go! Oh, I know! Want <i>takoyaki</i>?

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:30.810
<i>Takoyaki</i>?!

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:36.680
You can eat as much as you want!
After all, I've got tons of money now!

00:08:38.770 --> 00:08:40.640
Welcome!

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:43.600
One hundred <i>takoyaki</i>, please! I can afford it!

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:46.470
You could've fooled me with those clothes!

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:49.520
Huh? It's a long story.

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:55.560
Well, we're happy to serve anybody
as long as they pay! Just need your seal.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:57.470
Okay!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:57.810
"Super S-Rank Akudama"
