Um, it's not like that!

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:08.970
Akudama...

00:09:08.970 --> 00:09:09.970
Huh?

00:09:09.970 --> 00:09:12.850
Akudama!

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:14.930
Huh? You hear that?

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:19.390
