00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:35.220
Hurry! It's Swindler! Yes, the Akudama!

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:38.470
She's here at the Dotonbori <i>takoyaki </i>place!

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:40.930
Come and execute her!

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:44.430
"Super S-Rank Akudama"
"Reward" "Dead or Alive" "Execute"
"Swindler"

