I made it all the way back, too!

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:29.560
Son of a bitch!

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:32.600
It'd be different if Bro was here.

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:35.720
What the hell should I do?

00:10:35.720 --> 00:10:38.390
What's wrong, mister?

00:10:38.390 --> 00:10:41.520
Relax, mister! I ain't gonna hurt you!

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:45.600
Actually, I've got something
you're gonna love. Sound good?

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:46.970
Huh?

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:56.020
This stuff is pure as hell.
It'll make all your problems disappear.

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:58.390
"Kansai North Ward"
"Underground Bar 'Tsubo'"

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:58.390
It's bliss that feels like heaven.

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:00.930
Heaven, huh?

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:02.350
That sure sounds nice.

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:07.020
Oh, my. I thought I recognized
your ridiculous hair.

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:07.810
