You're being hunted.

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:22.310
Huh?!

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:26.100
H-Help me!

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:31.100
I warned you, didn't I? I helped plenty.

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:34.520
I... I know where the kid is!

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:38.560
Isn't that what you're after?!

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:44.970
Thanks.

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:48.350
If you're lying about knowing
where the kids are...

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:50.060
Huh?

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:51.810
Uh...

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:52.890
Of course not!

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:55.390
"Kansai Ruins #1"

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:55.390
One of the kids is at this marker!

00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:57.270
Probably Brother!

00:11:57.270 --> 00:12:00.020
I put a tracker in that charm of his!

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:03.720
I was gonna sell him out to
the Executioners and ruin his day!

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:06.680
The Execution Department took him away.

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:07.520
Huh?

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:11.350
But they don't have facilities around there.

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:13.310
That's intriguing.

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:15.270
Wanna come play with me?

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:17.350
No, I think I'll--

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:22.470
Did you think you could
escape me? An oaf like you?

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:25.310
Your hair, your clothes, your attitude...

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:28.470
It's all a farce to make
yourself seem important.

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:31.180
You killing the Executioner
was a lie, wasn't it?

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:32.720
That's not--

00:12:32.720 --> 00:12:37.560
You're too scared to kill someone.
I bet you chickened out.

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:41.970
If you cooperate with me,
I'll make you into a real man.

00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:42.430
"Do Not Enter"

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:47.180
"Kansai East Ward"
"Kansai Ruins #1"
"Do Not Enter"

00:12:54.720 --> 00:12:56.180
Rain, huh?

