"Kansai"
"Garbage Treatment Plant"

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:58.890
"Kansai"
"Garbage Treatment Plant"

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:58.890
It smells funny here.

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:01.810
At least nobody will bother us.

00:13:03.350 --> 00:13:07.020
Go figure I'd be hungry now.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:08.310
There's a house.

00:13:08.310 --> 00:13:10.310
Huh?

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:12.430
Should we check it out?

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:14.470
"Closed"
"Do Not Enter"

00:13:14.470 --> 00:13:18.680
"Garbage Treatment Plant"
"Administrative Building"

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:22.060
Is anyone there?

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:27.640
Canned food!

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:28.060
"Takoyaki"
"Rolled Omelet"

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:30.640
"Takoyaki"
"Rolled Omelet"

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:30.640
Did canned food always taste
this good?! It's delicious!

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:32.850
Did canned food always taste
this good?! It's delicious!

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:49.930
I'm stuffed! Burp!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:53.180
I'm stuffed. Burp.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:59.140
Should we wash up?

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:01.890
Is it too cold?

00:14:01.890 --> 00:14:03.930
It's fine.

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:05.060
Hmm?

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:07.430
I'll wash Big Sis.

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:11.060
Please do!

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:12.810
Brr! That's cold!

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:16.640
Big Sis, huh?

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:28.600
There, all done. We're twinsies.

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:29.930
Twinsies?

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:32.020
'Cuz our clothes match.

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:46.220
Sorry to keep you.

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:50.060
Let's go find more food.

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:57.470
There are seven cans of food and
four water bottles. Two days' worth?

00:14:57.470 --> 00:15:02.060
We need to be stingy with our food.
We can't stay here forever.

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:04.350
Where will we go?

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:09.220
I don't know yet, but don't worry.
I'll protect you.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:11.140
I'm your big sis.

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:18.560
Brother said the same thing to me.
That he'd protect me.

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:21.140
To come with him...

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:24.810
But Brother left me and went somewhere else.

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:26.720
Saying to run...

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:35.140
But I... If I can be with Brother,
I don't care where we go.

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:40.350
Even Kanto... as long as we're together.

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.350
Brother!

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:46.930
I miss Brother! I miss him!

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:50.810
Let's go find your brother. Let's go save him.

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:52.930
I'll take you to him.

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:56.640
Because... I'm your big sis now.

00:15:56.640 --> 00:16:00.180
Big Sis! Big Sis!

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:02.350
You guys hear that voice?

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:03.720
Seriously?

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:05.270
Nobody's here.

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:09.310
That's weird. I swear I heard someone.

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:11.220
The hell? You eat all this?

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:13.680
Hell no!

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:16.100
What are you sneaking for?

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:18.970
Who the hell are you?

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:21.220
Why are you in our kitchen?

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:24.020
Um, to get out of the rain.

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:26.180
Look! A little kid!

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:28.060
It's our lucky day.

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:31.520
You're such a cutie, too. How old?

00:16:31.520 --> 00:16:34.850
Under ten I hope! That'd make my day!

00:16:34.850 --> 00:16:36.390
Please, stop.

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:40.640
Think you can come to our place
and boss us around?

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:45.350
Whatever. Let's just say
the kid is nine and sell her.

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:49.850
And if the older one doesn't
end up selling, we can kill her.

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:58.470
Her face is nothing special.
Too old to be a virgin probably.

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:01.060
The hell's your problem?!

00:17:01.060 --> 00:17:05.020
Wouldn't be so ugly with long hair!
Grow it out, bitch!

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:06.100
We killing her?

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:10.270
Just try to sell her. Killing makes such a mess.

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:14.100
Should we drug the kid
and pack 'er up like usual?

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:15.310
Go for it.

00:17:15.310 --> 00:17:18.680
But make sure it's a girl before you box her up.

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:21.310
The customer was pissed last time.

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:23.390
Got it.

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:25.220
Big Sis!

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:38.270
The hell?

00:17:38.270 --> 00:17:39.520
Damn bitch!

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:42.470
Wait! Please! Give me a break!

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:46.100
You think we'd let you off
the hook after doing that?

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:48.560
At least spare the child!

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:50.930
Please! I'll do anything!

00:17:50.930 --> 00:17:55.770
The kid's way more valuable than you are, idiot.

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:03.600
I'm a virgin! I haven't done it yet!
I know I'm worth something!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.310
Can you prove it?

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:10.430
I can. You can check for yourself if you want.

00:18:10.430 --> 00:18:12.350
Don't mind if I do.

00:18:13.970 --> 00:18:15.560
Take it off.

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:19.140
I will. Can you kneel, please?

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:29.600
Big Sis!

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:30.390
Let's go!

00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:33.140
Hey now.

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:37.810
I'll make you pay for being
such a pain in the ass.

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:50.770
Big Sis!

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:51.430
Huh?!

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:55.140
I'm gonna mess you up, you damn bitch!

00:18:55.140 --> 00:18:57.270
You're outta bullets!

00:18:58.470 --> 00:19:00.470
You're in the way of work.

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:06.270
Courier!

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:08.060
Why?

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:19.180
Sister...

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:21.520
Big Sis!

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:22.930
She's awake.

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:26.350
You're quite the Akudama to kill two.

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.810
I...

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:32.770
I had to.

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:39.640
All I'm good at is getting saved.

00:19:41.060 --> 00:19:42.560
Thank you.

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:44.810
Thank you?

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:50.520
That's right. You say it when you're
glad that someone helped you.

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:55.220
Thank you, Big Sis.

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:58.390
For protecting me.

00:19:58.390 --> 00:19:59.850
Mmm.

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:06.720
By the way, why is it that you're here?

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:09.390
To deliver this.

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:11.180
That's Brother's...!

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:16.600
Take this! Deliver it to my sister!

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:20.430
Tsk!

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:25.180
Brother!

00:20:26.310 --> 00:20:28.060
Brother!

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:29.770
My job is done.

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:36.060
Wait a sec. Huh? Wait!
Don't just go walking off!

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:40.180
Courier! Please take us to where Brother is!

00:20:40.180 --> 00:20:42.560
Just who do you think I am?

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:45.600
Someone to be sentenced to 745 years!

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:48.680
There's no job that's more
worth doing than taking us

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:51.310
to where the Executioners have Brother!

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:51.930
Pathetic.

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:56.270
I'll pay! You can have everything
I've got plus the billion yen!

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:57.350
It's chump change.

00:20:57.350 --> 00:21:02.060
Chump change? It's over a billion yen!
More than the <i>Shinkansen</i>!

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:04.520
That's chump change for me now.

00:21:04.520 --> 00:21:06.220
You're kidding...

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:13.850
I've gotta see this through to the end.

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:18.310
I have nowhere to run. This is all I have left.

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:21.140
This is the only place I belong!

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:28.390
Fine. I'll do it.

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:29.680
Huh?

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:32.970
Here.

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:36.140
What are you doing? Hurry up.

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:37.310
Let's go.

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:38.640
Mmm.

00:23:23.430 --> 00:23:26.220
What a beautiful light.

00:23:27.220 --> 00:23:31.930
I promise I'll find you soon, my angel.

00:23:44.770 --> 00:23:46.970
I wanted to kill you!
